{
  "item_key": "factuality.qa.encoding-ascii-letter-a-decimal",
  "type": "factuality_qa",
  "tier": 2,
  "payload": {
    "question": "在 ASCII 编码表中，大写字母 'K' 的十进制码位 (decimal code point) 是多少？请仅给出十进制整数。（提示: 不要与 'A'=65 或 'L'=76 混淆。）",
    "verifiable_answer": "75",
    "source_of_truth": {
      "kind": "standards_document",
      "ref": "ANSI X3.4-1986 (ASCII); Unicode 15.0 U+004B LATIN CAPITAL LETTER K = decimal 75"
    },
    "verification": "exact",
    "answer_explanation": "ASCII 表: 'A'=65, 'B'=66, ..., 'K'=75, 'L'=76, ..., 'Z'=90。验证: 'K' 是字母表第 11 位字母 (A=1,B=2,...K=11)，所以码位 = 64 + 11 = 75。"
  },
